<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#FFFDF5">
  <meta name="description" content="Start a 30-day AdHello trial — pay-per-performance marketing, referral network, and reviews on every job. You only pay commission on leads you approve. No credit card.">
  <meta property="og:title" content="AdHello — pay-per-performance marketing &amp; referrals">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Get leads when you approve them, grow through referrals, and collect reviews on every job. 30 days free — no credit card.">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <title>Grow reviews &amp; referrals for your business · AdHello</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/adhello-app-icon.png" type="image/png">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/custom.css?v=<%= typeof assetVersion !== 'undefined' ? assetVersion : '1' %>">
  <%- include('partials/tailwind_css', { twVariant: 'standalone' }) %>
  <style>
    /* AdHello.io tokens — form-focused signup (sales lives on adhello.io) */
    :root {
      --fa-yellow: #facc15;
      --fa-yellow-hot: #eab308;
      --fa-ink: #1f242e;
      --fa-muted: rgba(31, 36, 46, 0.75);
      --fa-muted-soft: rgba(31, 36, 46, 0.6);
      --fa-cream: #FFFDF5;
      --fa-line: rgba(31, 36, 46, 0.1);
      --fa-font: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      --fa-btn-radius: 12px;
      --fa-btn-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }
    body.fa-page {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: var(--fa-font);
      background: var(--fa-cream);
      color: var(--fa-ink);
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .fa-main {
      min-height: 100vh;
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .fa-card {
      max-width: 28rem;
      width: 100%;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 1.25rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--fa-line);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 48px -24px rgba(31, 36, 46, 0.18);
      padding: 2rem;
    }
    @media (min-width: 640px) { .fa-card { padding: 2.5rem; } }
    .fa-brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.35rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
    }
    .fa-brand img { width: 2.5rem; height: 2.5rem; border-radius: 0.7rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .fa-brand strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--fa-ink);
      line-height: 1.15;
    }
    .fa-brand span {
      display: block;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--fa-muted-soft);
      margin-top: 0.1rem;
    }
    .fa-card h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      color: var(--fa-ink);
    }
    .fa-card-trial {
      margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.35;
      color: var(--fa-muted-soft);
    }
    .fa-card-lead {
      margin: 0.65rem 0 0;
      font-size: 0.925rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--fa-muted);
    }
    .fa-benefits {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 1.1rem 0 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.65rem;
    }
    .fa-benefits li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      padding: 0.7rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      background: rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.28);
    }
    .fa-benefits__ico {
      width: 2.6rem;
      height: 2.6rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 0.05rem;
      color: #1f242e;
      background: transparent;
      border: 0;
      box-shadow: none;
      border-radius: 0;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      line-height: 1;
    }
    .fa-benefits__ico svg {
      width: 2.35rem;
      height: 2.35rem;
      display: block;
    }
    .fa-benefits strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--fa-ink);
      line-height: 1.25;
    }
    .fa-benefits span {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 0.15rem;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      color: var(--fa-muted);
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .fa-field { margin-top: 0.9rem; }
    .fa-field label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--fa-muted-soft);
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    }
    .fa-field label .opt {
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: none;
      letter-spacing: 0;
      color: rgba(31, 36, 46, 0.45);
    }
    .fa-field input,
    .fa-field select,
    .fa-field textarea {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--fa-line);
      background: #fff;
      padding: 0 0.9rem;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: var(--fa-ink);
      outline: none;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: var(--fa-font);
    }
    .fa-field input,
    .fa-field select { height: 2.9rem; }
    .fa-field textarea {
      min-height: 4.5rem;
      padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
      resize: vertical;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    .fa-field input:focus,
    .fa-field select:focus,
    .fa-field textarea:focus {
      border-color: var(--fa-yellow-hot);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.28);
    }
    .fa-field-hint {
      margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.35;
      color: var(--fa-muted-soft);
    }
    .fa-grid2 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 479px) {
      .fa-grid2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    .fa-perks {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.4rem 1rem;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--fa-muted);
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .fa-perks span::before {
      content: '✓';
      color: #10b981;
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-right: 0.35rem;
    }
    .fa-terms {
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      font-size: 12.5px;
      line-height: 1.45;
      color: var(--fa-ink);
    }
    .fa-terms input {
      margin-top: 0.15rem;
      width: 1.1rem;
      height: 1.1rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      accent-color: var(--fa-yellow-hot);
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .fa-terms label { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; color: var(--fa-muted); }
    .fa-terms a { color: var(--fa-ink); font-weight: 800; text-decoration: underline; }
    .fa-terms-details {
      margin-top: 0.65rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--fa-line);
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      background: rgba(255, 253, 245, 0.8);
      padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--fa-muted);
    }
    .fa-terms-details summary {
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--fa-ink);
      list-style: none;
    }
    .fa-terms-details summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
    .fa-terms-details[open] summary { margin-bottom: 0.45rem; }
    .fa-terms-details ul { margin: 0.35rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.1rem; }
    .fa-terms-details li + li { margin-top: 0.25rem; }
    .fa-btn {
      width: 100%;
      height: 3.5rem;
      margin-top: 2.75rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: var(--fa-btn-radius);
      background: #facc15;
      color: #1f242e;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 16px;
      box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.15s;
      font-family: var(--fa-font);
    }
    .fa-btn:hover { background: #eab308; }
    .fa-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.72; cursor: wait; pointer-events: none; background: #e5c412; }
    .fa-foot { margin-top: 2.5rem; font-size: 12px; color: var(--fa-muted-soft); line-height: 1.45; }
    .fa-foot a { color: var(--fa-ink); font-weight: 700; }
    .fa-errors {
      background: #fef2f2;
      border: 1px solid #fecaca;
      color: #b91c1c;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .fa-errors li + li { margin-top: 0.2rem; }
    .fa-ok {
      background: #ecfdf5;
      border: 1px solid #a7f3d0;
      color: #065f46;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.45;
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
    }
    .fa-sent-steps {
      margin: 1rem 0 0;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.65rem;
    }
    .fa-sent-steps li {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.6rem 1fr;
      gap: 0.55rem;
      align-items: start;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      color: var(--fa-muted);
      counter-increment: fa-step;
    }
    .fa-sent-steps { counter-reset: fa-step; }
    .fa-sent-steps li::before {
      content: counter(fa-step);
      width: 1.6rem;
      height: 1.6rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #facc15;
      color: #1f242e;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 12px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .fa-sent-steps strong { color: var(--fa-ink); }
    .fa-back {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--fa-muted-soft);
    }
    .fa-back a { color: var(--fa-ink); font-weight: 700; }
    @media (max-width: 639px) {
      .fa-main { padding: 1.25rem 1rem; align-items: stretch; }
      .fa-card { border-radius: 1.1rem; padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem; }
      .fa-perks { gap: 0.35rem 0.85rem; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
      .fa-card { animation: fa-rise 0.45s ease-out both; }
      .fa-btn { transition: transform 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease; }
      .fa-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
      @keyframes fa-rise {
        from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
        to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="fa-page">
  <% const _f = form || {}; %>
  <% const _login = typeof loginHref !== 'undefined' ? loginHref : '/m/login'; %>
  <% const _trial = typeof trialSignupHref !== 'undefined' ? trialSignupHref : '/signup'; %>
  <% const _action = typeof formAction !== 'undefined' && formAction ? formAction : '/app'; %>
  <% const _joinName = typeof joinNetworkName !== 'undefined' ? String(joinNetworkName || '').trim() : ''; %>
  <% const _flooring = typeof flooringPartner !== 'undefined' ? !!flooringPartner : false; %>
  <main class="fa-main">
    <div class="fa-card">
      <a class="fa-brand" href="https://adhello.io" rel="noopener">
        <img src="/images/adhello-app-icon.png" alt="Reviews App" width="40" height="40" />
        <div>
          <strong>Reviews App</strong>
          <span><%= _joinName ? ('Join ' + _joinName) : (_flooring ? 'Flooring partners' : 'Pay-per-performance') %></span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <% if (sent) { %>
        <h1>Check your phone</h1>
        <p class="fa-card-lead">If that number or email is valid, your app link is on its way<% if (_joinName) { %> for <strong><%= _joinName %></strong><% } %>. Open it, then:</p>
        <ol class="fa-sent-steps" aria-label="Next steps">
          <li><strong>Add to Home Screen</strong> — Share → Add to Home Screen so it opens like an app.</li>
          <li><strong>Turn on phone alerts</strong> — allow notifications so leads, referrals, and News &amp; updates pop up on your phone.</li>
        </ol>
        <div class="fa-ok" role="status">Link sent. It can take a minute. Already have it? <a class="underline font-semibold" href="<%= _login %>">Get a fresh link</a>.</div>
        <% if (!_flooring) { %>
        <p class="fa-foot" style="margin-top:1.5rem">Want the full workspace (leads, SMS, email, GHL CRM)? <a class="underline" href="<%= _trial %>">Start a free trial</a>.</p>
        <% } %>
      <% } else { %>
        <h1>Grow reviews &amp; referrals for your business!</h1>
        <% if (_flooring) { %>
        <p class="fa-card-trial">Keep your account as long as you buy material from us</p>
        <p class="fa-card-lead">Built for flooring partners — reviews, jobs, and referrals on your phone. No timed trial. Lead delivery stays <strong>pay-per-performance</strong>: commission only on leads you approve.</p>
        <% } else { %>
        <p class="fa-card-trial">30-day free trial · no credit card</p>
        <p class="fa-card-lead"><% if (_joinName) { %>You’re joining <strong><%= _joinName %></strong> — <% } %>Grow with <strong>pay-per-performance marketing</strong> and a referral network — you only pay commission on leads you approve. Plus reviews and jobs on your phone.</p>
        <% } %>

        <ul class="fa-benefits" aria-label="What you get">
          <li>
            <span class="fa-benefits__ico" aria-hidden="true">
              <%# Heroicons outline: star %>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M11.48 3.499a.562.562 0 011.04 0l2.125 5.111a.563.563 0 00.475.345l5.518.442c.499.04.701.663.321.988l-4.204 3.602a.563.563 0 00-.182.557l1.285 5.385a.562.562 0 01-.84.61l-4.725-2.885a.563.563 0 00-.586 0L6.982 20.54a.562.562 0 01-.84-.61l1.285-5.386a.562.562 0 00-.182-.557l-4.204-3.602a.563.563 0 01.321-.988l5.518-.442a.563.563 0 00.475-.345L11.48 3.5z"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <div>
              <strong>Reviews &amp; CRM</strong>
              <span>Ask for Google reviews when the job wraps, and keep customers, jobs &amp; CRM on your Home Screen — no App Store.</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="fa-benefits__ico" aria-hidden="true">
              <%# Heroicons outline: user-group %>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M18 18.72a9.094 9.094 0 003.741-.479 3 3 0 00-4.682-2.72m.94 3.198l.001.031c0 .225-.012.447-.037.666A11.944 11.944 0 0112 21c-2.17 0-4.207-.576-5.963-1.584A6.062 6.062 0 016 18.719m12 0a5.971 5.971 0 00-.941-3.197m0 0A5.995 5.995 0 0012 12.75a5.995 5.995 0 00-5.058 2.772m0 0a3 3 0 00-4.681 2.72 8.986 8.986 0 003.74.477m.94-3.197a5.971 5.971 0 00-.94 3.197M15 6.75a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2.25 2.25 0 11-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 014.5 0zm-13.5 0a2.25 2.25 0 11-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 014.5 0z"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <div>
              <strong>Referral network that feeds you work</strong>
              <span>Send and receive referrals with partners in your area — grow without cold calling strangers. Closed jobs credit your ads account.</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="fa-benefits__ico" aria-hidden="true">
              <%# Heroicons outline: chart-bar %>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M3 13.125C3 12.504 3.504 12 4.125 12h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v6.75C7.5 20.496 6.996 21 6.375 21h-2.25A1.125 1.125 0 013 19.875v-6.75zM9.75 8.625c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v11.25c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V8.625zM16.5 4.125c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25C20.496 3 21 3.504 21 4.125v15.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V4.125z"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <div>
              <strong>Pay-per-performance marketing</strong>
              <span>Get leads through the app. Approve what you want — commission only on leads you accept. Decline the rest at no cost.</span>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="fa-perks"><span>Pay per performance</span><span>Referrals</span><span><%= _flooring ? 'Material partners' : '30-day free trial' %></span></div>

        <% if (errors && errors.length) { %>
          <ul class="fa-errors" role="alert">
            <% errors.forEach(function (e) { %><li><%= e %></li><% }) %>
          </ul>
        <% } %>

        <form method="post" action="<%= _action %>" class="mt-2" id="fa-form" autocomplete="on">
          <div class="fa-field">
            <label for="fa-name">Your name</label>
            <input id="fa-name" name="contactName" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="120" value="<%= _f.contactName || '' %>">
          </div>
          <div class="fa-field">
            <label for="fa-company">Business name</label>
            <input id="fa-company" name="companyName" autocomplete="organization" required maxlength="160" value="<%= _f.companyName || '' %>">
          </div>
          <div class="fa-field">
            <label for="fa-phone">Mobile number</label>
            <input id="fa-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" maxlength="40" value="<%= _f.phone || '' %>" placeholder="We’ll text your app link">
          </div>
          <div class="fa-field">
            <label for="fa-email">Email <span class="opt">(if you prefer email)</span></label>
            <input id="fa-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="200" value="<%= _f.email || '' %>">
          </div>
          <div class="fa-field">
            <label for="fa-trades">Trades or areas you work in</label>
            <textarea id="fa-trades" name="serviceTrades" required maxlength="200" rows="2" placeholder="<%= _flooring ? 'e.g. Hardwood, LVP, carpet, tile' : 'e.g. Flooring, carpet, LVP — or your trade' %>"><%= _f.serviceTrades || (_flooring ? 'Flooring' : '') %></textarea>
            <p class="fa-field-hint">What you do — used to match reviews and referrals.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fa-grid2">
            <div class="fa-field" style="margin-top:0.9rem">
              <label for="fa-city">City you work in</label>
              <input id="fa-city" name="serviceCity" autocomplete="address-level2" required maxlength="80" value="<%= _f.serviceCity || '' %>" placeholder="e.g. Camas">
            </div>
            <div class="fa-field" style="margin-top:0.9rem">
              <label for="fa-drive">Willing to drive</label>
              <select id="fa-drive" name="serviceRadiusMiles" required>
                <option value="">Max distance…</option>
                <% [10, 15, 20, 25, 30, 45, 60, 75, 100].forEach(function (mi) { %>
                <option value="<%= mi %>" <%= Number(_f.serviceRadiusMiles) === mi ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= mi %> miles</option>
                <% }) %>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="fa-field-hint" style="margin-top:0.35rem">City + drive distance = where you want reviews and referrals from.</p>

          <div class="fa-terms">
            <input id="fa-terms" name="acceptTerms" type="checkbox" value="on" required <%= _f.acceptTerms ? 'checked' : '' %>>
            <label for="fa-terms">
              <% if (_flooring) { %>
              I agree to the <a href="#fa-terms-details">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>: I keep Reviews App access
              <strong>as long as I buy material from you</strong>. Lead delivery is
              <strong>pay-per-performance</strong> — commission only on leads I <strong>approve</strong>.
              <% } else { %>
              I agree to the <a href="#fa-terms-details">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>: AdHello Reviews is a
              <strong>pay-per-performance</strong> model. I will pay commission on leads I receive through the app
              <strong>after I approve them</strong>.
              <% } %>
            </label>
          </div>
          <details class="fa-terms-details" id="fa-terms-details">
            <summary>Terms &amp; Conditions — <%= _flooring ? 'flooring partners' : 'pay-per-performance' %></summary>
            <ul>
              <% if (_flooring) { %>
              <li>Your Reviews App account stays active <strong>while you purchase material from us</strong> — there is no timed free trial.</li>
              <li>If material purchases stop, we may pause or end app access.</li>
              <li>Lead delivery is <strong>pay-per-performance</strong>: when you receive a lead, you choose whether to <strong>approve</strong> it.</li>
              <li>Approving a lead means you agree to pay the applicable <strong>commission</strong> for that lead.</li>
              <li>Declining a lead does not create a commission obligation for that lead.</li>
              <li>By checking the box above and submitting this form, you accept these Terms &amp; Conditions.</li>
              <% } else { %>
              <li>The Reviews app trial and core tools may be free; lead delivery is <strong>pay-per-performance</strong>.</li>
              <li>When you receive a lead through the app, you choose whether to <strong>approve</strong> (accept) it.</li>
              <li>Approving a lead means you agree to pay the applicable <strong>commission</strong> for that lead.</li>
              <li>Declining a lead does not create a commission obligation for that lead.</li>
              <li>By checking the box above and submitting this form, you accept these Terms &amp; Conditions.</li>
              <% } %>
            </ul>
          </details>

          <button type="submit" class="fa-btn" id="fa-submit"><%= _flooring ? 'Text me my app link' : 'Text me my trial link' %></button>
        </form>
        <script>
          (function () {
            var form = document.getElementById('fa-form');
            var btn = document.getElementById('fa-submit');
            if (!form || !btn) return;
            var locked = false;
            form.addEventListener('submit', function (ev) {
              if (locked) {
                ev.preventDefault();
                return;
              }
              locked = true;
              btn.disabled = true;
              btn.setAttribute('aria-busy', 'true');
              btn.textContent = 'Sending…';
            });
            if (document.querySelector('.fa-errors')) {
              form.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
            }
          })();
        </script>

        <p class="fa-foot">Already in a network? <a class="underline" href="<%= _login %>">Get your link</a>. Need leads + CRM? <a class="underline" href="<%= _trial %>">Start Agency OS trial</a>.</p>
      <% } %>
    </div>
    <p class="fa-back">Learn more at <a href="https://adhello.io" rel="noopener">adhello.io</a></p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
